#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1362
msgid ""
"An option is provided in the file allows the table to be presented in "
"landscape mode which allows wider tables to be included. For files which are"
" to be processed independently, the option can be changed in the document "
"class definition <_:screen-1/> by removing the percent symbol (%) in front "
"of <literal>,landscape</literal>. For files to be included as tables in "
"other LaTeX files, the preamble must include the <literal>lscape</literal> "
"package, as was explained above, and the two commands <_:screen-2/> must "
"have the leading percent sign removed."
msgstr ""
"Du kan använda ett alternativ i filen för att visa tabellen i liggande "
"format, vilket passar bredare tabeller. Om filen ska behandlas separat "
"ändrar du dokumentklassdefinitionen <_:screen-1/> genom att ta bort "
"procenttecknet (%) framför <literal>,landscape</literal>. Om filen ska "
"infogas som en tabell i en annan LaTeX-fil måste inledningen innehålla "
"paketet <literal>lscape</literal>, enligt beskrivningen ovan. Ta även bort "
"det inledande procenttecknet från de två kommandona <_:screen-2/>."

