#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1388
msgid ""
"An option is provided to change the widths of the columns of the file "
"generated by <application>Gnumeric</application>. By default, the file "
"attempts to maintain the proportions between the columns in the "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> worksheet, yet scale the resulting table"
" for the width of the paper defined in LaTeX. To change the column widths, "
"look for the section in the <application>LaTeX</application> file with lines"
" that look like <_:screen-1/> and that may have as many entries as there "
"were columns in the worksheet. The TeX 'lengths' defined for each column can"
" be changed. For example, change the second column (Column B) to a width of "
"0.75 inches, we would simply have to modify this code to: <_:screen-2/> and "
"the resulting file would have a second column 0.75 inches wide."
msgstr ""
"Du kan även ändra bredden på kolumnerna i filen som "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> skapar. Som standard försöker filen "
"behålla proportionerna mellan kolumnerna i kalkylbladet i "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> och samtidigt anpassa tabellens bredd "
"till pappersformatet i LaTeX. Om du vill ändra kolumnbredderna letar du upp "
"avsnittet i <application>LaTeX</application>-filen med rader som "
"<_:screen-1/>. Där kan det finnas lika många rader som kolumner i "
"kalkylbladet. Ändra LaTeX-måtten för respektive kolumn. Om du till exempel "
"vill att den andra kolumnen (kolumn B) ska vara 0,75 tum bred ändrar du "
"koden så här: <_:screen-2/>. Då blir den andra kolumnen i den skapade filen "
"0,75 tum bred."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1423
msgid ""
"An option to change the headers and footers of the table is provided as "
"well. The file itself contains comments on how to alter these but the "
"choices will require seeing the documentation of the "
"<literal>longtable</literal> LaTeX package. See that documentation and the "
"contents of the file generated by <application>Gnumeric</application> for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"Du kan även ändra tabellens sidhuvuden och sidfötter. Filen innehåller "
"kommentarer som beskriver hur du gör det, men du behöver läsa "
"dokumentationen för LaTeX-paketet <literal>longtable</literal>. Mer "
"information finns i dokumentationen och i filen från "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1450
msgid "Linear and Integer Program Expression (MPS) File Format"
msgstr "Filformatet Linear and Integer Program Expression (MPS)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1452
msgid ""
"The Linear and Integer Program Expression file format is a text file format,"
" encoded as ASCII, which uses fixed columns. The format was developed by "
"International Business Machines Corporation to express linear and integer "
"programs."
msgstr ""
"Linear and Integer Program Expression (MPS) är ett ASCII-kodat textformat "
"med fasta kolumner. International Business Machines Corporation tog fram "
"formatet för att beskriva linjära program och heltalsprogram."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1466
msgid "Linear and Integer Program Expression (MPS)"
msgstr "Linear and Integer Program Expression (MPS)"

