"file format."
msgstr "Flera andra program kan hantera filer i Microsoft Excelformat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1775
msgid "Microsoft Excel New Binary File Format"
msgstr "Microsoft Excels nya binärformat"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1777
msgid ""
"The Microsoft Excel<trademark/> New Binary file format is a binary file "
"format used by the <application>Excel</application> program in the "
"<application>Office</application> suite between versions 95 and 2003. The "
"format is a common format supported to various extents by most spreadsheets "
"although it is incompletely documented. The "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> project has reversed engineered all of "
"the core features of the format."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft Excel<trademark/>s nya binärformat används av programmet "
"<application>Excel</application> i paketet <application>Office</application>"
" i versionerna 95–2003. De flesta kalkylprogram stöder formatet i någon "
"utsträckning, även om dokumentationen är ofullständig. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>-projektet har baklängeskonstruerat alla "
"centrala funktioner i formatet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1859
msgid "Microsoft Excel 2003 XML File Format"
msgstr "Microsoft Excels XML-filformat från 2003"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1861
msgid ""
"Microsoft Excel<trademark/> 2003 shipped with a file format called "
"SpreadsheetML. This file is XML. It is not very common, but its core "
"features are supported."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft Excel<trademark/> 2003 introducerade filformatet SpreadsheetML. "
"Filen är XML-baserad. Formatet är ovanligt, men dess centrala funktioner "
"stöds."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1916 C/gnumeric.xml:2015
msgid "These are zip files containing SpreadsheetML files and binary files."
msgstr ""
"Det här är ZIP-filer som innehåller SpreadsheetML-filer och binärfiler."
